PHENICOL/QUINOLONE/RIFAMPIN/TETRACYCLINE\tPOINTX\t144\t144\t100.00\t98.61\t144\tWP_000843414.1\ttranscriptional regulator MarR\tNA\tNA\nNA\tcontig_1\t29355\t29786\t+\tmarR_R73R\ttranscriptional regulator MarR [WILDTYPE]\tcore\tAMR\tPOINT\tMULTIDRUG\tAMPICILLIN/CHLORAMPHENICOL/QUINOLONE/RIFAMPIN/TETRACYCLINE\tPOINTX\t144\t144\t100.00\t98.61\t144\tWP_000843414.1\ttranscriptional regulator MarR\tNA\tNA\nNA\tcontig_1\t29355\t29786\t+\tmarR_R77R\ttranscriptional regulator MarR [WILDTYPE]\tcore\tAMR\tPOINT\tMULTIDRUG\tAMPICILLIN/CHLORAMPHENICOL/QUINOLONE/RIFAMPIN/TETRACYCLINE\tPOINTX\t144\t144\t100.00\t98.61\t144\tWP_000843414.1\ttranscriptional regulator MarR\tNA\tNA\nSoftware version: 4.2.7\nDatabase directory: /Users/applemacbookpro/miniforge3/envs/amr/share/amrfinderplus/data/2026-10-29.1\nDatabase version: 2026-10-29.1\nAMRFinder translated nucleotide and mutation search\nRunning tblastn\nRunning blastn\nMaking report\namrfinder took 43 seconds to complete\n", "stderr": "", "tool": "command_execution", "source": "events.jsonl", "call_id": "item_11", "key_path": "item", "batch": "batch_008"}
